'''Maracaxá Air Base''' {{Airport codes|MAB|SBMA}} ({{lang-bl|Base Aeria de Maracaxá}}) is a base in western [[Pindorama]], in the [[Catanduva]] [[Regions of Balisca|region]]. It is located in the [[Maracaxá]] commune on the outskirts of [[Maracaju]], at the foot of the [[Tukãti Mountains]]. It forms part of [[Joint Base Maracaxá]], an amalgamated military base, alongside [[Naval Station Maracaxá]].

